  "mail.guide.title": "A journal for you",
  "mail.guide.text": "@!^^Mom says you're the new farmer. Welcome to the valley!^^I've been filling this journal with gadget ideas: chips, wire, even a whole farm computer. I copied it out for you. Tick things off as you try them, and I'll mail you blueprints when you're ready.^^Hold it and press the action button to read it. Lost it? The crafting menu can make another.^^   -Maru",

